<style is:global>
  /* ==========================================================================
     Shelly journal act (.sj): six live 2026-redraw screens, held in a single
     horizontal-scroll strip near the end of the case ("Redrawn, 2026"), plus
     a second strip of the three original 2025 screenshots right after
     chapters 01/02/03.
     SCOPE FENCE: every rule is fenced under .sj-compare, applied to each of
     the six live figures individually; the Field Journal palette, paper and
     hand-wobble exist nowhere else on the site. The phones are paper
     artefacts and stay light in dark mode (dimmed by the same brightness
     treatment as case images). Animation is transform/opacity/filter only;
     prefers-reduced-motion gets the complete static state.
     Ported wholesale from shelly-concepts.html's concept c1 ("Field
     Journal"), the pixel-truth reference for this palette and type. Colour
     is set explicitly everywhere it matters (headings, slider track/fill/
     handle) so no page-wide rule can win the cascade against it. */
  .sj-compare {
    --sjpaper: #F6F1E3; --sjink: #2A2921; --sjmoss: #8FAF77; --sjfern: #4C6B45;
    --sjberry: #C94F42; --sjochre: #D9A441;
